{"id":"7260fb0c7b9b84ea","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-solution.md","title":"Solution","display":"df-solution — Solution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-solution","aliases":["58-df-solution"],"display":"df-solution — Solution","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-solution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-solution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solution — Solution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\\varphi,x,a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\\varphi,x,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> (underlying carrier supplied by the satisfaction structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solution}_S(a,\\varphi,x;s,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\operatorname{Solution}_S(a,\\varphi,x;s,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\\operatorname{Solution}_S(a,\\varphi,x;s,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solution}\\vdash\\operatorname{Solution}_S(a,\\varphi,x;s,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A solution is an object satisfying the defining equation or condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})$ (see [[58-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)$ (underlying carrier supplied by the satisfaction structure, see [[58-df-satisfa